WEBVTT
NOTE Slow Swim: audio description track (kind="descriptions").

d1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Deep blue open water. A sea turtle swims slowly down and away from the camera.

d2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
It turns towards the camera, sweeping its front flippers, and rises towards the light.

d3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Close up from below: the turtle’s pale head and patterned shell pass just above the camera.

d4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Seen from the side, it glides on long, slow strokes. Its shell is brown with orange edges.

d5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.200
The turtle swims off into the blue and grows small in the distance.
